Project Roles and Responsibilities
Role	Responsibilities	Contribution to Success
Project Manager	Plans timelines, coordinates tasks, manages risks and communication.	Ensures smooth execution and team alignment.
Frontend Developers	Build user interfaces using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React.	Deliver responsive, intuitive user experiences.
Backend Developers	Develop APIs, manage databases, handle server logic and authentication.	Power core functionality and data flow.
Designers	Create wireframes, UI mockups, and ensure visual consistency.	Enhance usability and aesthetic appeal.
QA/Testers	Test features, report bugs, and ensure quality across devices.	Maintain reliability and user trust.
DevOps Engineers	Set up CI/CD pipelines, manage deployment, monitor performance.	Ensure stable, scalable, and secure infrastructure.
Product Owner	Defines project vision, prioritizes features, and gathers user feedback.	Aligns development with user needs and business goals.
Scrum Master	Facilitates agile ceremonies, removes blockers, supports team productivity.	Keeps the team focused and agile throughout development.

